x is composed of TBP, BDP1, and a complex containing both BRF2 and at least four stably associated proteins; this complex inhibits the transcription by pol III via its phosphorylation by CK2; YY1 facilitates the TFIIIB-alpha complex formation. Interacts with TBP; this interaction promotes recruitment of BRF2 to TATA box-containing promoters (PubMed:26638071). Interacts with TBP and the BURE sequence (GC-rich sequence downstream from the TATA box) to form a strong ternary complex which is joined by BDP1; this ternary complex stimulates pol III transcription. Forms a trimeric complex composed of TBP, BRF2 and mini-SNAPc complex (SNAP43, SNAP50, and the N-terminal third of SNAP190) on the promoter. Assembly of the TBP-BRF2 complex is stimulated by SNAP190. Interacts with MAF1 and SNAPC4"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"Q9HAW0-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":396,"transcripts":{"ensembl":[],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,9],[10,33,387]],"edits":[{"start":10,"end":32,"original":"CGSTELVEDSHYSQSQLVCSDCG","replacement":"","added":0}],"missing":23,"replaced":0,"novel":0,"foldedAbsent":19,"foldedMissing":19,"features":[[0,23,0],[2,1,0],[3,1,0],[4,1,0]],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q9HAW0-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q9HAW0-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":83.8,"plddt":[[0,18],[50,8],[0,1],[50,13],[70,3],[90,246],[70,2],[50,7],[0,32],[50,2],[70,2],[90,5],[70,5],[50,3],[70,1],[50,1],[70,5],[90,30],[70,5],[50,7]],"losingConfidence":10}}],"ensemblGenes":["ENSG00000104221.14"],"unmapped":{"ensembl":[],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[]},"coding":{"genes":[{"id":"ENSG00000104221","name":"BRF2","chromosome":"chr8","readthrough":false}],"gencode":3,"mapped":1},"explorer":{"gene":null,"isoforms":null},"locus":"chr8:37843268-37849861","exons":{"transcript":"ENST00000220659.11","first":1,"junctions":[154,214,536]},"structures":{"Q9HAW0-1":{"transcript":"ENST00000220659.11","strand":-1,